					<m_str type="a">IicDrv will support:%0D
1.	Standard Mode(100kbps), Fast Mode (400kbps), Fast Mode Plus(1Mbps) (fast mode plus not supported for TI)%0D
2.	Traveo II microcontrollers ; TI am62px %0D
3.	All I2c Hardware Channels supported by the microcontroller through configuration%0D
4.	Master Mode%0D
5.            Slave Mode - Not supported for TI based controllers%0D
6.	Asynchronous mode of Data Transfer%0D
7.	FIFO buffer based data transfer%0D
</m_str>
					<m_style type="a">Arial; 10 0 0 0 1 </m_style>
					<m_color type="p">
						<IColor type="e">
							<m_fgColor type="a">0</m_fgColor>
