				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq14\fcharset0 Tahoma;}{\f1\fmodern\fprq9\fcharset0 Tahoma;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs16 IicDrv will support:\par%0D
1.\tab Standard Mode(100kbps), Fast Mode (400kbps), Fast Mode Plus(1Mbps) (fast mode plus not supported for TI)\par%0D
2.\tab Traveo II \ul microcontroller\ulnone s ; TI am62px \par%0D
3.\tab All I2c Hardware Channels supported by the microcontroller through configuration\par%0D
4.\tab Master Mode\par%0D
5.            Slave Mode - Not supported for TI based controllers\par%0D
6.\tab Asynchronous mode of Data Transfer\par%0D
7.\tab FIFO buffer based data transfer\par%0D
\f1\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
