\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs16 entire i2c network busy external master is in control and transmitting.\par%0D
Suggests that the external master is still in control and so the \ulwave seq\ulnone  is failed.\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
			</m_pNoteText>
		</CGIAnnotation>
