				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fprq12\fcharset0 Tahoma;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs16 Result of a particular sequence if it is not equal to I2C_SEQ_OK\par%0D
means the \ulwave Traveo\ulnone  is going to be Master and address the slave requests and Master Intr will be executed.\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
