\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs16 When the TV \ulwave ii\ulnone  is Master and is the only Master available in the bus. This is executed if the bus is busy the very first time i2c is up and also if the single sequence keeps it busy even after its allocated bus time.\par%0D
